# 强制 GitHub linguist 将仓库主语言判定为 Java
# 防止 .github/workflows/*.yml 等其它扩展名影响语言统计，
# 使仓库语言标签稳定显示为「Java」（本应用为 Android/Java 原生开发）。
* linguist-language=Java
*.md linguist-language=Markdown
*.yml linguist-language=Markdown
*.yaml linguist-language=Markdown
*.xml linguist-language=Markdown
*.gradle linguist-language=Markdown
*.properties linguist-language=Markdown
*.zip linguist-language=Java
.gitattributes linguist-vendored
